From 54b7668ae1e84efb31bbffdbddfadfccf4268381 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: unrahul <unrahul@users.noreply.archlinux.org>
Date: Thu, 9 Apr 2026 11:42:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/12] sycl: replace dpct::permute_sub_group_by_xor with
 native SYCL

Replace all dpct shuffle wrappers with sycl::select_from_group across
common.hpp (11 warp_reduce variants), mmvq.cpp (10), dmmv.cpp (7),
ggml-sycl.cpp (2), fattn-common.hpp (2), fattn-vec.hpp (1).

Also fix barrier() calls to use local_space fence (done in prior patch
but included here for files that changed).

This removes the last dpct dependency from the hot compute path.
The dpct helper library is still linked for other utilities.
---
 ggml/src/ggml-sycl/common.hpp       | 121 +++++++++++-----------------
 ggml/src/ggml-sycl/dmmv.cpp         |  14 ++--
 ggml/src/ggml-sycl/fattn-common.hpp |   5 +-
 ggml/src/ggml-sycl/fattn-vec.hpp    |  13 ++-
 ggml/src/ggml-sycl/ggml-sycl.cpp    |  14 ++--
 ggml/src/ggml-sycl/mmvq.cpp         |  20 ++---
 6 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 106 deletions(-)

